				<title>SCP-5485</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-13965019/scp-5485</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Wed, 30 Dec 2020 07:50:39 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>ISNorden</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>6966599</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>As much mundanity as this skip exudes, he ought to act as a sapient Scranton Reality Anchor. (&quot;That's impossible,&quot; the Normal Man would deadpan as the most ordinary reslity in the multiverse happened around him &#8212; a dull gray bubble of blandness in a rainbow-hued sea of mystery.) Paradoxically, the Foundation would love having this man on their side; he'd suppress any anomalous events long enough to buy them time or help capture difficult reality-benders.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
