					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-13964752</guid>
				<title>███-3955</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-13964752/3955</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Tue, 29 Dec 2020 22:51:20 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>Henzoid</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>5190300</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <div style="text-align: center;"> <p><strong><a href="https://youtu.be/zHE_n3XA9C8" target="_blank">Gravity drags me deep beneath the cavity in the rocky sand</a></strong><br /> <strong><a href="https://youtu.be/zHE_n3XA9C8" target="_blank">Blue turns to pitch black as I sink into the land</a></strong><br /> <strong><a href="https://youtu.be/zHE_n3XA9C8" target="_blank">Gravity renders me a ragdoll, tumbling to the chasm floor</a></strong><br /> <strong><a href="https://youtu.be/zHE_n3XA9C8" target="_blank">Looking up at the ceiling miles below the shore</a></strong></p> </div> <hr /> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">Licensing&nbsp;Stuff</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">Boo,&nbsp;did&nbsp;I&nbsp;scare&nbsp;ya?</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <p>All images and music made by me, Henzoid.</p> <p>Huh, I guess I didn't really need a collapsible to say that, but here we are.</p> <p>Thanks Licensing Team! You guys rock.</p> </div> </div> </div> <hr /> <p>This SCP was written in honor of the lovely <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/placeholder-mcd" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6536693&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609282309" alt="Placeholder McD" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6536693)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/placeholder-mcd" >Placeholder McD</a></span> for the Holiday Gift-Swap. This gift was super fun to write, in part because Placeholder and I have near-identical taste in SCPs. In fact, though the main premise is brand new, I've been meaning to do a music SCP like this for quite some time, but never found the motivation. But, enough about me, here's to Placeholder MCD: An incredible author, and a lovely human being. Cheers!</p> <hr /> <p>Thanks to my gorgeous critters:<br /> - <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/crocket-lawnchair" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3205961&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609282309" alt="Crocket_Lawnchair" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3205961)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/crocket-lawnchair" >Crocket_Lawnchair</a></span><br /> - <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/darkstuff" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1581620&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609282309" alt="DarkStuff" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1581620)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/darkstuff" >DarkStuff</a></span><br /> - <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/brewsterion-1017" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3093017&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609282309" alt="Brewsterion 1017" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3093017)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/brewsterion-1017" >Brewsterion 1017</a></span><br /> - <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/elunerazim" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5226742&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609282309" alt="Elunerazim" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5226742)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/elunerazim" >Elunerazim</a></span><br /> - <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/yossipossi" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2199269&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609282309" alt="Yossipossi" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2199269)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/yossipossi" >Yossipossi</a></span></p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
