					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-13964563</guid>
				<title>SCP-3476</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-13964563/scp-3476</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Tue, 29 Dec 2020 17:23:31 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>JakdragonX</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>5588260</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <div style="text-align: center;"> <blockquote> <p><em>So now they both dead.</em><br /> <em>And you slash your own throat.</em><br /> <em>So now it's double homicide and suicide—with no note!</em><br /> <em>I shoulda known better, when you started to act weird,</em><br /> <em>We coulda— hey, where you going? Get back here!</em><br /> <em>&#8212; Eminem, <a href="https://youtu.be/-SeVN2u5Axc">Kim</a></em></p> </blockquote> </div> <p>This is my gift to the lovely <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/gabriel-mcqueen" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4558836&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609277745" alt="Gabriel McQueen" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4558836)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/gabriel-mcqueen" >Gabriel McQueen</a></span>, whos request was:</p> <blockquote> <p>I'd love a tale, article, or poem about a location made strange, lonely, or haunted. Something has happened here, it may be unclear just what, before the time that the story picks up, that has changed a once innocuous place into something…else.</p> </blockquote> <p>I hope you enjoy! This article is heavily inspired by both the quote above and <a href="https://youtu.be/6uFWshoWTLU">Water Fountain</a>, as well as another Eminem song that's referenced (little easter egg, teehee). You should definitely listen to the two linked here though! (<strong>NSFW, CONTENT WARNING</strong>)</p> <p>Thanks to <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dysadron" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4384469&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609277745" alt="Dysadron" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4384469)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dysadron" >Dysadron</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/pedagon" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5903100&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609277745" alt="Pedagon" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5903100)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/pedagon" >Pedagon</a></span>, and <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/uncle-nicolini" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3487700&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609277745" alt="Uncle Nicolini" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3487700)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/uncle-nicolini" >Uncle Nicolini</a></span> for their critique and help! Thank you <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/darkstuff" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1581620&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609277745" alt="DarkStuff" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1581620)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/darkstuff" >DarkStuff</a></span> and <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/elogee-fishtruck" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4037075&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609277745" alt="Elogee FishTruck" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4037075)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/elogee-fishtruck" >Elogee FishTruck</a></span> for hosting the exchange and <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/estrellayoshte" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3781861&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609277745" alt="EstrellaYoshte" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3781861)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/estrellayoshte" >EstrellaYoshte</a></span> for the lovely image at the top! Oh, and the theme!</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
